 "specials_footnote": "The Sakura Video Diary specials were received by providing proof of purchase of the required home video releases. The release dates provided are based on the release date of the final volume required to receive the special. The actual release date is likely sometime later, but an exact date is not known. | ShortSummary = Bonus video for purchasing Volumes 1-9 of the Laserdisc or VHS release for the TV series Tomoyo wants to produce what she calls a \"Sakura-chan Memorial\" and is shown recording scenes featured in the opening theme song video of the first season, including a scene where Sakura sings the theme song. When the opening video is completed, Tomoyo reveals to Sakura that the project encompasses 35 episodes of Sakura's exploits while she captured the Clow Cards in the first season, which will be broadcast on TV, much to Sakura's embarrassment. The completed opening video is shown with Sakura singing the song \"Catch You Catch Me\". Chronologically, this takes place anytime after episode 35. | LineColor = f9c2e2 Episode list | EpisodeNumber = 2 | Title = You're Wonderful, Sakura-chan! Tomoyo's Cardcaptor Sakura Video Diary 2! | TranslitTitle = Suteki desu wa, Sakura-chan! Tomoyo no Kādokyaputā Sakura Katsuyaku Bideo Nikki 2! | NativeTitle = すてきですわ、さくらちゃん! 知世のカードキャプターさくら 活躍ビデオ日記 2! | NativeTitleLangCode = ja | DirectedBy = Tetsurō Araki | WrittenBy = Tsutomu Kaneko | OriginalAirDate = Start date|2000|05|25",
 "dub_footnotes": {
  "Ep1": "Episodes 1 and 41 of Cardcaptor Sakura are combined into US episode 21 of Cardcaptors (with the same title, \"One Fateful Day\", as episode 1 in other English-speaking territories).",
  "Ep47": "Scenes from episodes 47, 48 and 58 of Cardcaptor Sakura are combined into US episode 24 of Cardcaptors, \"The Past, The Present and The Future\".",
  "Ep48": "Episodes 47 and 48 of Cardcaptor Sakura are combined into US episode 25 of Cardcaptors, \"A Strange New Beginning\".",
  "Ep50": "Episodes 50 and 51 of Cardcaptor Sakura are combined into US episode 27 of Cardcaptors, \"A New Set of Wings\".",
  "Ep65": "Episodes 65 and 66 of Cardcaptor Sakura are combined into US episode 35 of Cardcaptors, \"The Vanishing Act\"."
 },
